n, in consequence of alliance with those endowed with prowess, the exceedingly potent Rāghavas.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.658,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-69-9"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1068011","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"f6e755dc6e088667dcaa1145c2d0a2ccf24c3a8466c0bca4588b703c044956b1","compact":"017b21116266821050434dd81977778d1e9ca921faca0cec52a472db8d221472","nasal":"5763301254ef6eb9dacea5679ffbfb01a8688525bcc11aa97989ebf1c1194b6b"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-68-12","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":68,"verse":12,"english":"O lord of men, to-morrow morning after the completion of the sacrifice, do you perform the nuptials, in company with the foremost of the saints.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.694,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-69-10"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1068012","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"6e882100111a6dad51c2248b2cc5be8b6756d40795b04183df2d7e720b772e1c","compact":"e6e105af0ce151db7e5253dfde39542b3002520f5b79907577824bb4dd4ce9be","nasal":"20b1766d11cf5536ee7d92522f1a0f70527777b6fdd7d0bf4843315da091cf78"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-68-13","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":68,"verse":13,"english":"Hearing his speech in the midst of the saints, that best of those conversant with words, the lord of men, replied to the monarch, saying,","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-69-11"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1068013","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"a87811c1e64b0d2511117aed80359f01d14a4f09cc9d1aec1e7fb0f48ea267be","compact":"17102334d28da856dda08d2ba00cdb34f37ca0d5116eaf33333e8ec86eaa53c8","nasal":"17102334d28da856dda08d2ba00cdb34f37ca0d5116eaf33333e8ec86eaa53c8"}